:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Rampage Cats (Enemy)]].''
'''Sports Day Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Autumn = Sports Day! (Monthly Event)|Autumn = Sports Day!]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.5 Update|Version 2.0.5]]. [[True Form]] grants increased range and [[Immune to Warp]], but increases time between attacks. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], it can be obtained in the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|stage 48]] in Chapter 1.

